flowchart TD
A[Student submits request] --> B[Check required information]
B --> C{Information complete?}
C -- No --> D[Return for correction]
D --> A
C -- Yes --> E[Assign responsible owner]
E --> F[Review and approve if required]
F --> G{Approved?}
G -- No --> H[Notify student]
G -- Yes --> I[Complete request]
I --> J[Record outcome and notify student]
